  "description": "IoT Generic Database Driver — standards-compliant SQL-based driver implementing IDriver/DriverBase. Maps SQL query results to IPoint data via IoTDatabaseDriver. Built on XCode DAL for multi-database support (MySQL, SQLite, SQL Server, Oracle, PostgreSQL, DaMeng).  |  IoT通用数据库驱动，符合IoT标准的SQL驱动实现，通过IoTDatabaseDriver将查询结果映射为IPoint数据，基于XCode DAL支持多数据库。",
